# Origin of the SPY-DER FastAPI surface (spy_der/app/api.py).
#
# Leave UNSET to run against the built-in synthetic generator — the UI labels
# itself "Synthetic data" and every number is fabricated.
#
# The engine binds 127.0.0.1 on the VPS by design and must never be published
# directly. Point this at a reverse proxy that terminates TLS and authenticates,
# Dashboard (public): https://iron-spyder.vercel.app
# Engine origin (server-only BFF), e.g. the VPS Caddy edge:
#
# SPYDER_API_BASE=https://srv1874660.hstgr.cloud
